 is blue and purity is white. One way or another, they will manifest. They will face you and you will have to pay your penance. Nothing stays neither the same nor unreturned. \n\nYour actions have their consequences. \n\nSimilar to John Locke’s tabula rasa… At first, your tally is all empty. It gets filled with emotions as time passes. Though you may not realize, you are the manifestation itself.\n\n3125x6250 px  \n39 MB  \nIllustrated by GRUFF","image":{"kind":"image","thumb":"/media/61302cc0f4b80555-t.webp","large":"/media/61302cc0f4b80555-l.webp","file":null},"animation":null,"mint":{"at":"2023-05-22T20:42:47.000Z","txHash":"0xa8b5904f5fe5e6f79b5050753ba80a07df304d2325619088d05be5344148b13d","priceWei":null,"primary":false},"lastSale":null,"listing":null,"supply":1,"holderCount":1,"owners":[{"address":"0x5cbef4dce6ed8b75cea9637df4c4b946705a0171","ens":"xlanskyvault.eth","quantity":1}],"recent":[{"id":"0x413e0c1a849b5b77e67a05d37ca6004a4ae639021715b4c5f23dc24f3308e9f0:192:3","kind":"transfer","contract":"0xf808228c5dd6e5b0a8f80c55c83c54f5520d15d5","tokenId":"3","quantity":1,"from":"0x3a88bc828083eadea53f87520250e092b72350f2","to":"0x5cbef4dce6ed8b75cea9637df4c4b946705a0171","priceWei":null,"txHash":"0x413e0c1a849b5b77e67a05d37ca6004a4ae639021715b4c5f23dc24f3308e9f0","timestamp":"2023-06-25T16:17:47.000Z"},{"id":"0x2459fe11c28182dd32206d9eb97995405a80053e9d1de11a9bca8e8d53d21216:251:3","kind":"transfer","contract":"0xf808228c5dd6e5b0a8f80c55c83c54f5520d15d5","tokenId":"3","quantity":1,"from":"0xcda72070e455bb31c7690a170224ce43623d0b6f","to":"0x3a88bc828083eadea53f87520250e092b72350f2","priceWei":null,"txHash":"0x2459fe11c28182dd32206d9eb97995405a80053e9d1de11a9bca8e8d53d21216","timestamp":"2023-06-20T17:52:11.000Z"},{"id":"0xc10d8e2d0c5c46fa4bed7fc56aada2222848389d91f3977814c53283d3383197:243:3","kind":"transfer","contract":"0xf808228c5dd6e5b0a8f80c55c83c54f5520d15d5","tokenId":"3","quantity":1,"from":"0x4730497622bdfd6eafe1f09fa22b3a0aca94a646","to":"0xcda72070e45